{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "New Paths", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "On the Weekend ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for and Responding to Suggestions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you ask for or make suggestions, you use modals.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you make a <span class=\"strong\">suggestion</span>, you give ideas or ways to do something. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: We could go to the supermarket first.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you respond to a <span class=\"strong\">suggestion</span>, you let the person know how you feel about their suggestion in a polite way. <br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: That sounds good.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Ask/Make Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Respond to Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hmm, should I make a Thai curry?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's a great idea!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Shall I help you?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thanks!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Oh, we could go to the new outlet mall!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You guys are shopaholics!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Let's go out for dinner!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd like that!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How about a movie!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">OK, sounds good. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Family", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about family, you often describe their personal qualities.   You can talk about their  behavior and their personalities.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Behavior is the way a person  acts or conducts themselves. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Tom is usually relaxed, but today he seems nervous.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Personality is a person's  general character (they way they are). <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Synonym\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"demanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"exacting; tough\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"picky\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fussy; particular\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"predictable\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"as expected \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"grouchy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"surly; testy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"embarrassing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"disconcerting; upsetting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"presumptuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rude; pretentious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"uncompromising\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inflexible; obstinate\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You're so predictable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I know I get grouchy when I shop. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That's very presumptuous of you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I can be a little picky sometimes.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "outlet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place that sells goods at a reduced price ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We going to the outlet to shop for new clothes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you talk with friends.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "engagement", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an agreement to marry someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We celebrated their engagement with a small dinner.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shopaholic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who enjoys shopping and does it a lot ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are shopaholics. Shopping is always first on their list. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "indecisive ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "finds it difficult to make a decision ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is so indecisive. She can never make up her mind. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "personal shopper ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who finds clothing and accessories for you ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He has a personal shopper find his clothing for him. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "picky", "type": "name"}, {"content": "careful to choose only what you like", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Tom is a picky eater. He doesn't like new things. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "predictable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "does as expected", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Anna is predictable. She never surprises us. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "grouchy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not kind; always complaining ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She gets grouchy when she doesn't sleep well. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "demanding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "expecting a lot of effort or work ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our manager is very demanding. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to text", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to send a message with a cellphone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Text me when you finish work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob09aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Invite two friends to go out and do something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make several suggestions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Have your friends respond to the suggestions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Decide where to go and what to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue with two other people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue inviting two friends to do something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make suggestions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I respond to suggestions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "1", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What should we do this weekend, guys? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm going shopping for an engagement present for John.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's a great idea! You're so thoughtful, Sally. Oh, we could go to the new outlet mall! It opens early tomorrow!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You two are shopaholics - I can't keep up! I'm too indecisive when I shop.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: More like stubborn, Peter. Shall I help you?  I got a lot of experience shopping in Europe. <br>"}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob09re2img04.jpg", "time": "28000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, with your personal shopper! I'm really picky when I shop. I might need a personal shopper  myself.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: One can dream, Vanessa. So, after we go shopping, what will you want to do?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Eat!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I knew you'd say that! You're so predictable. Let me guess - you're going to cook for us?<br>"}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "53000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I know I get grouchy when I shop. Food is a good pick-me-up. What are you going to make for us, V?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You guys are so demanding!  Hmm, should I make a Thai curry?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sounds great! We're having dinner at V's house on Saturday! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's a date! <br>"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le01ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can ask and respond to suggestions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action, plans and intentions.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about personal qualities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How often do you go out with your friends?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you suggest doing?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Where do you suggest going? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correc